,$ then\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d x} = 4\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d x = \\dfrac 1 4 \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nThen, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {3}^{5+4x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {3}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int {3}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{{3}^{u}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{3}^{5+4x}}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "19fd901f-e08d-54c5-9cda-68543a3d71a9" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186097220 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9abbe1a2-b532-51a1-80f3-e85520454526" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2^{6x - 1}}{\\ln 2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095250} {:answer/id #uuid "b2030311-b93b-5086-ac8a-22c14254a5bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2^{3x - 1}}{6} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095251} {:answer/id #uuid "f17de8b1-8c36-542e-8869-051ce59fb3e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2^{6x - 1}}{6} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095252} {:answer/id #uuid "34308b09-4153-58b1-9482-a404961a3981" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2^{6x - 1}}{6\\ln 2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095253} {:answer/id #uuid "572cb874-e27a-510f-85d8-8a946c5bb585" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2^{3x - 1}}{\\ln 2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095254}] :answer-field/id #uuid "c5ec82f4-c60f-506f-8243-a969fdc4fa8a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186095249}] :question/id #uuid "11de273d-2b3c-5d60-8d62-a5a765ac49f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-31405" :question/problem "What is $\\displaystyle \\int2^{6x - 1}dx$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186097221 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a0a1db5-167b-5